Administrative rules-independent review and
HB0312
analysis.
Sponsored By: Representative(s) Wasserburger
AN ACT relating to administrative procedure; creating the regulatory review
office; specifying duties and powers of the office; requiring analyses for each
rule promulgated under the Wyoming Administrative Procedure Act; requiring
reports; authorizing positions; providing an appropriation; specifying
applicability; and providing for effective dates.
